# Force LF line endings in the working tree on every platform, regardless of
# a user's global core.autocrlf. Without this, Windows checkouts convert
# LF -> CRLF and corrupt bootstrap.sh (bash chokes on \r in the shebang and
# every subsequent line): "$'\r': command not found", syntax errors on `{`.
* text=auto eol=lf

# text=auto's binary auto-detection would normally already catch this, but
# make it explicit: never run eol conversion or text diffing on the
# Hindsight memory snapshot (git's heuristic only samples the file).
omp/hindsight-backup.zip -text -diff
